        <h2>Special Collections Research Center - Closed</h2>
        <p>The Breckinridge Research Room will be closed starting May 11, 2026, and anticipates re-opening Fall semester 2026 in an alternate location for the duration of the King Library renovation. </p>
        <p>Reproduction requests will still be available during the closure.</p>
        <p>
            <a class="underline-link" href="https://libraries.uky.edu/ContactSCRC">Contact SCRC</a> with questions.
